27;true&#x27;]:text-strong">ngrok opened the door for Databricks to rapidly onboard big enterprise customers with comprehensive security much less operational complexity.</p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/home/databricks-wordmark.svg" alt="Databricks" width="150" height="24" class="relative mt-4 h-6 w-37.5 invert dark:invert-0"/><img aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/home/databricks.svg" alt="" width="164" height="178" class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-14 -bottom-10 h-44.5 w-41 opacity-5 invert select-none dark:invert-0"/></div></div><div data-slot="card" class="border-card bg-card border rounded-xl relative group overflow-hidden" data-spotlight="false"><div data-slot="card-body" class="p-6 border-t border-card-muted first:border-t-0 flex flex-col gap-2"><div><div class="text-body group-data-[spotlight~=&#x27;true&#x27;]:text-strong text-lg font-semibold">Kevin Simper</div><div class="text-muted group-data-[spotlight~=&#x27;true&#x27;]:text-body text-sm">@kevinsimper</div></div><p class="text-body text-base group-data-[spotlight~=&#x27;true&#x27;]:text-strong">I wouldn&#x27;t know how to work without ngrok.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex w-80 shrink-0 flex-col gap-4"><div data-slot="card" class="border-card bg-card border rounded-xl relative group overflow-hidden" data-spotlight="false"><div data-slot="card-body" class="p-6 border-t border-card-muted first:border-t-0 flex flex-col gap-2"><div><div class="text-body group-data-[spotlight~=&#x27;true&#x27;]:text-strong text-lg font-semibold">Brian Cantrell</div><div class="text-muted group-data-[spotlight~=&#x27;true&#x27;]:text-body text-sm">@briancantrell</div></div><p class="text-body text-base group-data-[spotlight~=&#x27;true&#x27;]:text-strong">ngrok is making my life so much better.</p></div></div><div data-slot="card" class="border-card bg-card border rounded-xl relative group overflow-hidden" data-spotlight="false"><div data-slot="card-body" clas